Description: DNS server serving records from a MySQL/MariaDB database
 MyDNS is an authoritative DNS server that answers queries directly from
 zone and resource record tables in an SQL database, so zones can be changed
 without reloading the server. It supports AXFR/IXFR, NOTIFY, DNS UPDATE and
 forwarding to a recursive resolver.
 .
 This package is built with the MySQL/MariaDB backend.
